cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TAVI in your research, please cite this software."
type: software

title: "TAVI: Triple-Axis Virtual Instrument"

authors:
  - family-names: Merritt
    given-names: Adrian

abstract: >-
  TAVI is a graphical interface for simulating neutron
  triple-axis spectrometer experiments, providing
  instrument configuration, scans, and visualization
  using McStas and McStasScript.

repository-code: "https://github.com/ammerritt-gh/TAVI-Triple-Axis-Virtual-Instrument"
url: "https://github.com/ammerritt-gh/TAVI-Triple-Axis-Virtual-Instrument"

keywords:
  - neutron scattering
  - triple-axis spectrometry
  - instrument simulation
  - McStas
